{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8e7bc6712e1934ae55da1a5bc554d347b285efefa4b05e56428a80a0ba62e6c9","ja":"これって、大手化粧品メーカーが開発した、\nアダルティでセクシーになれるクリームらしいの♪","zh":"这好像是大牌化妆品厂商研发的，\n能让人变得成熟又性感的面霜哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"123d24f0a9b1b8d7fa01e31dd0568017e19fa426f724396404f2096e3b049240","ja":"今大人気で、在庫もない状態らしいんだけど……\nはい、特別にまつりちゃんにもお裾分けしちゃうわ。","zh":"现在非常有人气，好像已经卖断货了……\n来，特别分给茉莉一点吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"622e1904e1c3d81c986576c688f156d03dd474a118ed4ce868b6d1d0399ffe1e","ja":"ありがとうなのです♪　これでまつりも、\nアダルティでセクシーな姫に大変身！なのですよ♪","zh":"太感谢了♪这样一来茉莉也能\n大变身，成为成熟性感的公主了哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1c5d6c6d46720e18453b2144324a83bf86da6d1c42ef181363ea04b20fc353dc","ja":"ええ。真美ちゃんには内緒で、\nふたりで超絶セクシーになっちゃいましょう！","zh":"嗯。瞒着真美，\n就我们两个人变得超级性感吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"21872e300394dba1290bbdef207390ae6e5c7e7665d14fdd9b6d459876e9dc5d","ja":"（な、なんだって～～っ！？）","zh":"（什、什么～～！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"72863eacfd6c01a807a2673e810e656996bd0cbb919a262d4d41ee73488df6c2","ja":"ちょ～っと、待った～～～っ！","zh":"等～～～一下！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"d8444e18325a2242be19f34bb665655e32ad44b8b1b2b9b69cc5d4a18499ce30","ja":"ここで会ったが30分前！\nせくしーになれるクリームとは、見過ごせねぇぜぇ！","zh":"冤家路窄，不过才刚见过30分钟！\n能让人变得性感的面霜，我可不能视而不见啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"37516816187a48dc2b004d1ad2c4ce8ce6b35cb471ab52cef6c897e2d84a0934","ja":"りおっちの旦那、\n真美にもひとつおくんなまし……。","zh":"莉绪姐老爷，\n也给真美来一个呗……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"ccc5142694b367b1f6950f081b07605dea7b41920c1f0e5f47bb6961c65bcf6e","ja":"……って、あれ？\n何も持ってないじゃ～～ん！？","zh":"……不对，咦？\n怎么什么都没拿嘛～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"5b3ca9fffdd63af3be340a3f6f2e1fcaee47bad6bc9d35ec2e0b51e2b5e6e417","ja":"ふふっ。\n真美ちゃん、お帰りなさい、なのです♪","zh":"呵呵。\n真美，欢迎回来♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"4baf88330ad485dc67901ba70ed3dd2c33e4f23177e6174815f8495cb6123679","ja":"ま、まさか、真美をおびき寄せるために\nお芝居してたってこと！？　ふたりともひどいよ～！","zh":"难、难道说，你们是为了引真美上钩\n才在演戏吗！？两个人也太过分了吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"f6ee2b01b9e96b6c25ad9fb7bc153c42915f0fac4838788285b58cd437319253","ja":"あら、クリームがあるのは本当よ？\nちゃんと真美ちゃんにもあげるから、安心して♪","zh":"哎呀，真的有奶油哦？\n放心吧，我也会好好分给真美一份的♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"0a6defb0d1a3f9a2e7f5d2a945dfb5d33cd873e92ae0f16534dbaa37ab10d293","ja":"で・す・が……。\nお掃除が終わるまでは、おあずけ！なのです！","zh":"但·是……。\n大扫除结束之前，先忍耐一下！不可以哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1513.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"7a0d2e2ac25eee7f901560ce77db11be98256e25cf01a402995ba4909419e4a3","ja":"うう……じゃあ、ちゃんと掃除するしか\nないんじゃん！　悔し～っ！","zh":"呜呜……那岂不是只能\n好好打扫了吗！好不甘心～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
